flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md S1, H-01, H-02, Release 1; business-analysis.md FR-03.

    start([Start: user needs a prompt])
    registry[Registry]
    has_prompts{Registry has prompts?}
    empty[Empty Portfolio]
    search[Search, Tags, and Filters]
    results{Matching prompt found?}
    no_results[Unverified / TBD: No Results]
    permission{User has access?\nRules: Unverified / TBD}
    denied[Access Unavailable]
    detail[Prompt Detail]
    trusted{Trusted revision available?}
    status[Draft or In Review State]
    trusted_detail[Trusted Revision]
    end_found([End: trusted revision identified])
    end_register([End: continue to Register Prompt flow])

    start -->|Open Registry| registry
    registry --> has_prompts
    has_prompts -->|No| empty
    empty -->|Add prompt| end_register
    has_prompts -->|Yes| search
    search -->|Search or filter by owner, status, access, revision, or application| results
    results -->|No| no_results
    no_results -->|Refine search| search
    no_results -->|Add prompt| end_register
    results -->|Yes: select prompt| permission
    permission -->|No| denied
    denied -->|Return to Registry| registry
    permission -->|Yes| detail
    detail --> trusted
    trusted -->|No| status
    status -->|Return to results| search
    trusted -->|Yes| trusted_detail
    trusted_detail --> end_found
